[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8582.15, "timestamp": "02:23:02", "text": "我的头就像她在流水一样，然后它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8584.87, "timestamp": "02:23:04", "text": "它就这么突然断电了，但甚至都没断电。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8586.79, "timestamp": "02:23:06", "text": "把那个给我。所以当时我就非常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8588.63, "timestamp": "02:23:08", "text": "使困惑。我当时就想，你知道吗，我们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8591.349, "timestamp": "02:23:11", "text": "我们自己去查一下。所以呢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8593.99, "timestamp": "02:23:13", "text": "发生了吗？我翻看了一遍，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8596.87, "timestamp": "02:23:16", "text": "你当时正在直播，但我那愚蠢的 YouTube"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8599.15, "timestamp": "02:23:19", "text": "不喜欢，我不知道，反正就是不喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8602.95, "timestamp": "02:23:22", "text": "一切如常。当然。就像和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8605.349, "timestamp": "02:23:25", "text": "然后我瞥见了。我当时就想，“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8608.469, "timestamp": "02:23:28", "text": "你都400岁了，我之前不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8610.75, "timestamp": "02:23:30", "text": "我当时说：“是啊，我就是这样认识你的。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8614.309, "timestamp": "02:23:34", "text": "数字。” 这是最近的一次直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8617.429, "timestamp": "02:23:37", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8619.59, "timestamp": "02:23:39", "text": "我想我错过了你的另外两件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8621.99, "timestamp": "02:23:41", "text": "直播，但我认为我可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8623.51, "timestamp": "02:23:43", "text": "因为YouTube那件蠢事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8625.75, "timestamp": "02:23:45", "text": "这就是我为什么想念你的直播的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8627.91, "timestamp": "02:23:47", "text": "中间部分。可能是任何事，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8631.83, "timestamp": "02:23:51", "text": "实际上。是的。是的。是的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8634.95, "timestamp": "02:23:54", "text": "我就是这样得到你的数字，比如100。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8639.349, "timestamp": "02:23:59", "text": "加。是的。所以，最近，嗯，我……"}]